('g1-english-adv-8a6ccb73ff5a', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-recognition', 'mcq', 4, 'school', 'Which one is NOT a school thing?', null, '["pencil","ruler","cat","book"]', '{"text":"cat","index":2}', '''Cat'' là con mèo - động vật. Pencil, ruler, book đều là đồ dùng học tập.', 'Phân biệt đồ dùng học tập với động vật.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"school","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '710c29bdea35b47c', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-052bccd57315', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-recognition', 'mcq', 4, 'colors', 'A banana is yellow. A strawberry is ___.', null, '["yellow","red","blue","green"]', '{"text":"red","index":1}', 'Dâu tây (strawberry) màu đỏ - red. Chuối vàng, nhưng dâu không vàng.', 'Ghép màu sắc với đồ vật thật.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"colors","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '7e3e4726ac7f92a4', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-4e3c3e2920d8', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 4, 'family', 'My mother''s son is my ___.', null, '["sister","brother","father","grandma"]', '{"text":"brother","index":1}', 'Con trai của mẹ mình là anh/em trai - brother. Câu đố quan hệ gia đình.', 'Suy luận quan hệ gia đình.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"family","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'ccc3001161ee01d9', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-a0d61cdcf841', 1, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 4, 'to-be', 'Choose the correct sentence.', null, '["I is a student.","I am a student.","I are a student.","I be a student."]', '{"text":"I am a student.","index":1}', 'Động từ ''to be'' với I luôn là ''am'': I am a student. Bẫy kinh điển của be.', 'Dùng đúng am/is/are với chủ ngữ I.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"to-be","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'f78bad04422c995e', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-ab69bf6f3936', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 4, 'numbers', 'How many legs do TWO cats have?', null, '["four","six","eight","ten"]', '{"text":"eight","index":2}', 'Mỗi con mèo 4 chân, 2 con = 4 + 4 = 8 chân - eight. Câu tổng hợp từ vựng số + kiến thức thật.', 'Kết hợp từ vựng số với kiến thức thực tế.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"numbers","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '347362e54f58f7c9', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-8490c33dd09b', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 4, 'body', 'Touch your ___. It is between your eyes and your mouth.', null, '["nose","ear","hand","foot"]', '{"text":"nose","index":0}', 'Mũi (nose) nằm giữa mắt và miệng - mô tả vị trí trên mặt.', 'Hiểu mô tả vị trí bộ phận cơ thể.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"body","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '3f7ba281cb4c9bf8', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-770040e7147c', 1, 'english', 'communication', 'functional-language', 'mcq', 4, 'greetings', 'A: "Hello, what''s your name?"  B: "___"', null, '["I am seven years old.","My name is Linh.","I am fine, thanks.","Goodbye!"]', '{"text":"My name is Linh.","index":1}', 'Hỏi tên (what''s your name) → trả lời tên: ''My name is Linh.'' Các câu khác trả lời tuổi hoặc sức khỏe.', 'Trả lời đúng câu hỏi tên.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"greetings","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '817cbcd917870e73', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-747fde971ffa', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-recognition', 'mcq', 4, 'animals', 'Which animal says "woof woof"?', null, '["a cat","a bird","a dog","a fish"]', '{"text":"a dog","index":2}', '''Woof woof'' là tiếng chó sủa - dog. Mèo kêu ''meow'', chim ''tweet''.', 'Ghép tiếng kêu với động vật.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"animals","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '3cd80af041cb652b', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-09509592fc41', 1, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 4, 'plurals', 'I can see two ___.', null, '["cat","cats","a cat","cates"]', '{"text":"cats","index":1}', 'Sau ''two'' cần danh từ số nhiều: cats. ''Cates'' là dạng sai - không có từ này.', 'Dùng danh từ số nhiều sau số lượng.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"plurals","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '7ffe8e0363cff9c5', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-f9de361e57c5', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 4, 'toys', 'You can bounce and kick this toy. What is it?', null, '["a doll","a ball","a teddy bear","a kite"]', '{"text":"a ball","index":1}', 'Bóng (ball) có thể nảy (bounce) và đá (kick). Búp bê và gấu bông không dùng để đá.', 'Suy luận đồ vật từ mô tả hành động.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"toys","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'c47719db39f8f115', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-3f2a6d00f64d', 1, 'english', 'phonics', 'phonics-pronunciation', 'mcq', 4, 'sounds', 'Which word starts with the same sound as "cat"?', null, '["city","cake","chair","cent"]', '{"text":"cake","index":1}', '''Cat'' và ''cake'' cùng âm /k/ ở đầu. ''City'' và ''cent'' đọc /s/ - bẫy chữ c hai cách đọc.', 'Nhận biết âm đầu /k/ của chữ c.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"sounds","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '57dbfd917e5ac767', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-30206324dc9b', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 4, 'school', 'You write on it with chalk or a pen. What is it?', null, '["a board","a bag","a desk","a pencil"]', '{"text":"a board","index":0}', 'Viết lên bằng phấn hoặc bút → bảng (board). Bút chì là dụng cụ viết, không phải bề mặt.', 'Phân biệt đồ vật trong lớp học.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"school","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '2d58ce3b0b6b4c91', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-f43bc4f00cec', 1, 'english', 'reading', 'reading', 'true-false', 4, 'mini-read', 'Read the passage. True or False?', null, '["True","False"]', '{"boolean":false}', 'Bài đọc nói ''a long tail'' - đuôi DÀI, nên câu ''short tail'' là Sai.', 'Đọc hiểu chi tiết trong đoạn 3 câu.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"mini-read","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '0c700844f7506e3c', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', 'This is my dog. It is black. It has a long tail.', 'The dog has a short tail.', null),
('g1-english-adv-cd1e1bf2220b', 1, 'english', 'writing', 'writing', 'reorder', 4, 'word-order', 'Rearrange the words to make a correct sentence.', null, null, '{"text":"This is my pencil."}', 'Cấu trúc giới thiệu: This is + đồ vật. ''This is my pencil.'' - giới thiệu bút chì của mình.', 'Sắp xếp câu giới thiệu đồ vật.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"word-order","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'e94aec1169e1babb', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, '["is","my","This","pencil"]'),
('g1-english-adv-b9c571efb85c', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-recognition', 'mcq', 4, 'face', 'Which one is NOT on your face?', null, '["eyes","nose","knee","mouth"]', '{"text":"knee","index":2}', 'Knee (đầu gối) ở chân, không phải trên mặt. Mắt, mũi, miệng đều trên mặt.', 'Phân biệt bộ phận mặt và bộ phận khác.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"face","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '56aaa7f378d2f937', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-12fde0b99774', 1, 'english', 'communication', 'functional-language', 'mcq', 4, 'polite', 'Your friend gives you a pencil. What do you say?', null, '["Goodbye!","Thank you!","I am sorry.","What is this?"]', '{"text":"Thank you!","index":1}', 'Được tặng đồ → nói cảm ơn: ''Thank you!''. Phép lịch sự cơ bản.', 'Dùng lời cảm ơn đúng tình huống.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"polite","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '153e414b385ee875', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-d17ca70916ca', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 5, 'numbers', 'I have ten fingers. I hide three fingers. How many fingers can you see?', null, '["three","seven","ten","thirteen"]', '{"text":"seven","index":1}', '10 - 3 = 7 ngón còn nhìn thấy - seven. Câu vừa tính vừa đọc hiểu.', 'Kết hợp phép trừ đơn giản với từ vựng số.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"numbers","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '4ac0f95c7ca271f4', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-8f565ccb2621', 1, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 5, 'this-that', 'Choose the correct sentence about a dog FAR away.', null, '["This is a dog.","That is a dog.","These is a dog.","Dog that is."]', '{"text":"That is a dog.","index":1}', 'Vật ở XA dùng ''that'' - ''That is a dog''. ''This'' dùng cho vật gần.', 'Phân biệt this (gần) và that (xa).', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"this-that","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '3fa0fee303a8006b', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-b6e61c2b252e', 1, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-recognition', 'mcq', 4, 'food', 'Which one is a drink?', null, '["rice","bread","milk","egg"]', '{"text":"milk","index":2}', 'Milk (sữa) là đồ UỐNG. Cơm, bánh mì, trứng là đồ ăn.', 'Phân biệt đồ ăn và đồ uống.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"food","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'a920ec9c5910e09d', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g1-english-adv-0ee7207985a1', 1, 'english', 'reading', 'reading', 'true-false', 5, 'mini-read', 'Read the passage. True or False?', null, '["True","False"]', '{"boolean":false}', 'Bài chỉ nói mèo nhỏ, chó to - KHÔNG nói chim nhỏ. Không có thông tin nên câu này sai.', 'Phân biệt thông tin có và không có trong bài đọc.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"mini-read","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'f6dfa68d4778d419', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', 'I have three pets: a cat, a dog and a bird. The cat is small. The dog is big.', 'The bird is small.', null),
('g2-english-adv-7f62fc6e337b', 2, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-recognition', 'mcq', 4, 'weather', 'Which one is NOT a kind of weather?', null, '["sunny","rainy","windy","hungry"]', '{"text":"hungry","index":3}', '''Hungry'' (đói) là cảm giác, không phải thời tiết. Sunny, rainy, windy đều là thời tiết.', 'Phân biệt từ chỉ thời tiết và cảm giác.', '{"grade":2,"coreTopic":"weather","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'a08589efc5ce8f30', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
