('g4-english-adv-e78a2a338343', 4, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 4, 'routines', 'I brush my teeth ___ a day - in the morning and before bed.', null, '["once","twice","three times","never"]', '{"text":"twice","index":1}', 'Sáng + trước khi ngủ = 2 lần → twice. Once là 1 lần.', 'Dùng once/twice/times cho tần suất.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"routines","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '38811e270de849bf', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g4-english-adv-a03aa3372164', 4, 'english', 'reading', 'reading', 'true-false', 4, 'mini-read', 'Read the passage. True or False?', null, '["True","False"]', '{"boolean":false}', 'Bài nói rõ gấu trúc con ''cannot see when it is born'' - mới sinh chưa nhìn được. Đọc kỹ phần phủ định.', 'Đọc hiểu chi tiết có phủ định.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"mini-read","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'e468f32f039ec9a9', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', 'Pandas live in China. They eat bamboo for 12 hours every day. A baby panda is pink and very small - it cannot see when it is born.', 'A baby panda can see when it is born.', null),
