('g4-english-adv-10fe5ebb43dc', 4, 'english', 'writing', 'writing', 'reorder', 5, 'word-order', 'Rearrange the words to make a correct sentence.', null, null, '{"text":"I went to the zoo yesterday."}', 'Quá khứ: chủ ngữ + V2 + nơi chốn + thời gian. ''I went to the zoo yesterday.'' - 7 từ cần sắp đúng trật tự.', 'Sắp xếp câu quá khứ dài đúng trật tự.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"word-order","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '61400453de480038', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, '["yesterday","went","I","to","zoo","the","."]'),
('g5-english-adv-be74bc0b31aa', 5, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 4, 'past-simple', 'They ___ in Ha Long Bay last summer.', null, '["are","were","was","be"]', '{"text":"were","index":1}', '''They'' số nhiều + ''last summer'' → were. ''Was'' chỉ đi với I/he/she/it.', 'Dùng was/were đúng ngôi thì quá khứ.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"past-simple","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '489148054745ee82', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
