('g5-english-adv-af1b59308efb', 5, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 5, 'environment', 'We should ___ plastic bags to protect the ocean.', null, '["use more","reuse or reduce","throw into rivers","burn in the garden"]', '{"text":"reuse or reduce","index":1}', 'Bảo vệ đại dương → tái sử dụng hoặc giảm dùng (reuse or reduce) túi nilon. Các đáp án khác gây hại.', 'Từ vựng chủ đề bảo vệ môi trường.', '{"grade":5,"coreTopic":"environment","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '9d3bdb25b856184a', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
