('g3-english-adv-71158f79cca1', 3, 'english', 'vocabulary', 'vocabulary-in-context', 'mcq', 5, 'weather', 'It is not hot and not cold - about 20 degrees. The weather is ___.', null, '["freezing","warm","boiling","stormy"]', '{"text":"warm","index":1}', 'Không nóng không lạnh, 20 độ → ấm áp (warm). Freezing là giá lạnh, boiling là nóng sôi.', 'Chọn từ thời tiết theo nhiệt độ.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"weather","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'e247f14d864d6817', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-english-adv-c42671d4cda9', 3, 'english', 'reading', 'reading', 'true-false', 5, 'mini-read', 'Read the passage. True or False?', null, '["True","False"]', '{"boolean":false}', 'Bài nói ''Lunch is at the farm'' - ăn trưa ở TRANG TRẠI, không phải ở trường. Chi tiết cuối bài.', 'Đọc kỹ địa điểm trong thông tin chuyến đi.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"mini-read","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '0da54a627b55f154', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', 'The school trip is on Saturday. Students meet at the school gate at 7:30. They must bring a hat and a water bottle. Lunch is at the farm.', 'Students eat lunch at school.', null),
('g3-english-adv-09d261372cd7', 3, 'english', 'grammar', 'grammar-use-of-english', 'mcq', 5, 'frequency', 'I ___ eat sweets - only on my birthday.', null, '["always","usually","often","rarely"]', '{"text":"rarely","index":3}', 'Chỉ ngày sinh nhật = gần như không bao giờ → rarely (hiếm khi). Always/usually/often đều quá nhiều.', 'Chọn trạng từ tần suất theo ngữ cảnh.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"frequency","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '7f0d0a63ef4354dd', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g3-english-adv-1d0b8671cbe5', 3, 'english', 'communication', 'functional-language', 'mcq', 4, 'opinions', 'A: "I think maths is fun!"  B does NOT agree. B says: "___"', null, '["Me too!","I think so too.","I do not think so - it is boring!","Yes, maths is fun!"]', '{"text":"I do not think so - it is boring!","index":2}', 'Không đồng ý → ''I do not think so''. Ba câu kia đều đồng thuận - đọc kỹ chữ NOT.', 'Nhận biết câu bày tỏ bất đồng.', '{"grade":3,"coreTopic":"opinions","moetSubject":"English","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'f0dba9b6caa9e8b7', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
