('g1-math-adv-6c93b25f0f67', 1, 'math', 'data', 'data', 'mcq', 4, 'sorting', 'There are 3 cats, 5 dogs and 1 bird. How many pets are there in all?', null, '["8","9","10","4"]', '{"text":"9","index":1}', '3 + 5 + 1 = 9 con thú cưng. Đề hỏi TỔNG cả 3 nhóm, không chỉ 2 nhóm.', 'Tổng hợp dữ liệu nhiều nhóm đơn giản.', '{"grade":1,"coreTopic":"sorting","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '279255c84b8e4f41', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
