('g4-math-adv-05e5fd07656b', 4, 'math', 'number', 'fractions', 'mcq', 4, 'fractions', 'Which fraction is the BIGGEST?', null, '["1/2","1/3","1/4","1/8"]', '{"text":"1/2","index":0}', 'Cùng tử số 1: mẫu càng nhỏ phân số càng LỚN. 1/2 lớn nhất - bẫy kinh điển là nghĩ 1/8 lớn vì 8 lớn.', 'So sánh phân số cùng tử số.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"fractions","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'd16eb05cd5df243b', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g4-math-adv-01086742f24b', 4, 'math', 'number', 'fractions', 'mcq', 4, 'fractions', 'What is 3/4 of 20?', null, '["12","15","16","80"]', '{"text":"15","index":1}', '3/4 của 20 = 20 ÷ 4 x 3 = 5 x 3 = 15. Chia mẫu trước, nhân tử sau.', 'Tính phân số của một số.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"fractions","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '161d254d31a2e339', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
('g4-math-adv-be9f9af44409', 4, 'math', 'problem-solving', 'problem-solving', 'mcq', 4, 'word-problems', 'A train travels 90 km every hour. How far does it travel in 3 hours and 30 minutes?', null, '["270 km","300 km","315 km","360 km"]', '{"text":"315 km","index":2}', '3 giờ: 90 x 3 = 270 km. Nửa giờ: 90 ÷ 2 = 45 km. Tổng 270 + 45 = 315 km.', 'Tính quãng đường với thời gian lẻ nửa giờ.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"word-problems","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', 'ac99c060a5ea4555', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
