('g4-math-adv-88b18c7c21a4', 4, 'math', 'data', 'data', 'mcq', 5, 'averages', 'Minh scores 8, 9 and 10 in three quizzes. What is his average score?', null, '["8","9","10","27"]', '{"text":"9","index":1}', 'Trung bình = (8 + 9 + 10) ÷ 3 = 27 ÷ 3 = 9. Nhiễu 27 là tổng, quên chia.', 'Tính trung bình cộng đơn giản.', '{"grade":4,"coreTopic":"averages","moetSubject":"Mathematics","alignmentLevel":"topic-skill","curriculumRole":"extension","primaryFramework":"MOET-2018"}', null, true, null, 'owned-original-generated', 'machine-editorial-reviewed-human-academic-signoff-required', '{"examEligible":false,"mockEligible":true,"practiceEligible":true,"commercialReleaseEligible":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForExam":true,"requiresHumanApprovalForCommercialRelease":false}', '73ff11ae145718b1', '{"kind":"generated-v6","method":"cr59-authored-advanced","provenance":"Hand-authored advanced item; original, not copied from a textbook or competition bank."}', '6.0', null, null, null),
